<title>UK: Bank Handlowy sets $150 mln 3-year bond, +60 bp.</title>
<headline>Bank Handlowy sets $150 mln 3-year bond, +60 bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HANDLOWY FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANK HANDLOWY</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    14.MAY.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.798    PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	REOFFER    99.798    SPREAD	+60 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA3	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/PL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  POLAND    TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY NOTES -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
